<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <title>Temporarily unavailable - <%= appname %></title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #222; background: #fff; margin: 0; padding: 3em 1em; }
    main { max-width: 36em; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.5; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Temporarily unavailable</h1>
    <p>Volunteer logins, registration and uploads on <%= appname %> are temporarily unavailable while we complete some security work. Searching is still available.</p>
    <p><a href="<%= main_app.root_path %>">Go to <%= appname %> search</a></p>
    <p>We'll share updates on our <a href="https://www.facebook.com/freeukgen">Facebook page</a>. Thank you for your patience.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
